 "text_original": "This is a real run, not a replay. The agents read the letter, and the Registry Scout asks Zetaris for the vendor's corporate family. The letter's address belongs to a different Booz Allen entity, so the Registrar adds that entity to Zetaris as a session table, in the middle of the check. The Examiner will not accept the new link until it has re-run the query in Zetaris and the row hash matches. In the evidence drawer, every fact shows its lineage: source system, Zetaris table, query id, SQL hash and row hash.",
